Glacies had faced the Snow Lady but was saved by Branwen, the Lady of Spring. Reluctantly, Glacies agreed to train her combat skills with Raory, one of the Royal Council's combat experts. The fairies and the Elemental Priestesses are getting ready to begin the plan to lure the Snow Lady out of her palace.

Bring Kelvezu to the bottom of the sea with the egg. The grudge the Snowstorm Dragon holds against it will make it leave its den.

[Challenge Objective]

Activate the Kelvezu Egg in the marked area of the Frozen Abyss of the Sea and defeat the Snowstorm Dragon.
When you are done, talk to Commander Derik in Ricarten.
